OL,3,CMan charged with murder after body
OL,4,Cfound at house in Barnsley
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a body was found at a house in
OL,8,FBarnsley.
OL,10,FAndrew Fowler, 60, was arrested after
OL,11,Fthe discovery on George Street in
OL,12,FWorsborough Bridge on the night of
OL,13,FFriday 14 August.
OL,15,FIt follows reports earlier that day of
OL,16,Fa missing 62-year-old man from
OL,17,FSheffield.
