OL,3,CMan charged with murder after body
OL,4,Cfound at house in Barnsley
OL,6,FFowler has been remanded into custody
OL,7,Fand is due to appear at Barnsley
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court on Monday 17
OL,9,FAugust).
OL,11,FThe family of the man who died are
OL,12,Fbeing supported by specially trained
OL,13,Fofficers.
OL,15,FA cordon is still in place and
OL,16,Fofficers are asking anyone with
OL,17,Finformation to contact them.
